WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.773
Apply the distinctions to three decisions.

2
00:00:02.773 --> 00:00:08.848
First, decide which claim about the two embedded configurations matches the parameter files.

3
00:00:08.848 --> 00:00:15.253
Second, identify what is still needed after selecting an application-oriented core configuration.

4
00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:19.412
Third, decide what a successful smoke regression can establish.

5
00:00:19.412 --> 00:00:21.657
Use the source links if necessary.

6
00:00:21.657 --> 00:00:32.420
The goal is not to memorise every extension flag, but to connect a technical statement to the configuration, system boundary and evidence that actually support it.

